<div type="level1" xml:id="wibarab.paratexts.initiating-fieldwork">
  <head>Initiating Fieldwork</head>
  <p><hi rendition="simple:bold">January 2022 – May 2022</hi>: PhD
  students Antonella Torzullo, Gunda Kinzl, Terlan Djavadova, Claudia
  Laaber and post-doc. Dr. Ana Iriarte Díez begin their first fieldwork
  in the framework of the project. They conduct linguistic
  investigations in Jordan, Saudi Arabia, Morocco and Lebanon. More
  information on their experiences can be found in the ‘blog’ section of
  our website.</p>
  <p><ref target="text:wibarab.paratexts.blog">Go to
  Blog</ref></p>
</div>

